  "content": "<div>\n<h2>\nBuy Me a Coffee ☕️\n</h2>\n<div>\n<p>你好，我是刘家财（网络 ID：写代码的西瓜、jiacai2050）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>正在创作 <a href=\"https://emacstalk.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EmacsTalk</a>/<a href=\"https://rusttalk.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RustTalk</a> 两档播客</li>\n<li>也在更新个人<a href=\"https://liujiacai.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">中文博客</a>、 <a href=\"https://en.liujiacai.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">英文博客</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>\n在线服务\n</h2>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://api.liujiacai.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">公共 API</a>，包括 <code>/proxy</code> 代理访问、 <code>/podcast</code> 代理播客等服务</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://edgebin.liujiacai.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Edgebin</a>，一个功能强大的 HTTP 测试服务</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>\n开源项目\n</h2>\n<div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zigcc.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Zig 语言中文社区</a></td>\n<td>主要负责<a href=\"https://github.com/zigcc/forum/discussions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">论坛</a>和<a href=\"https://zigcc.github.io/monthly/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">月报</a>两个板块的运营</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jiacai2050/zigcli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">zigcli</a></td>\n<td>A toolkit for building command lines programs in Zig.</td>\n<td>Zig</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jiacai2050/zig-curl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">zig-curl</a></td>\n<td>Zig bindings to libcurl.</td>\n<td>Zig</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jiacai2050/zig-emacs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">zig-emacs</a></td>\n<td>Zig binding for Emacs&#x27;s dynamic modules</td>\n<td>Zig</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jiacai2050/zig-napi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">zig-napi</a></td>\n<td>Node API binding for Zig</td>\n<td>Zig</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/1History/1History\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1History</a></td>\n<td>命令行工具，备份浏览器历史记录，提供可视化分析的功能</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/1History/eww-history-ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">eww-history-ext</a></td>\n<td>Emacs 插件，持久化 EWW 历史记录</td>\n<td>Rust、ELisp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jiacai2050/oh-my-github/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">oh-my-github</a></td>\n<td>持久化 GitHub 上的仓库到本地 SQLite 数据库中</td>\n<td>C、ELisp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"Http://liujiacai.net/gooreplacer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gooreplacer</a></td>\n<td>A browser extension to modify HTTP requests</td>\n<td>Clojure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jiacai2050/learn_clojure.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Clojure 教学视频</a></td>\n<td>国内第一套 Clojure 视频课程</td>\n<td>Clojure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"http://liujiacai.net/scheme.clj/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scheme.clj</a></td>\n<td>Scheme 解释器，Clojure(Script) 实现</td>\n<td>Clojure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jiacai2050/JCScheme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">JCScheme</a></td>\n<td>Scheme 解释器，支持正则序与应用序两种求值方式</td>\n<td>Java</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/jiacai2050/sicp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SICP 读书笔记</a></td>\n<td>SICP 读书笔记与习题解答</td>\n<td>Scheme</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>\n如果以上内容对您有所帮助，欢迎打赏支持。\n</h2>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>\n爱发电\n</h3>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://afdian.net/@liujiacai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://afdian.net/@liujiacai</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>\nPayPal\n</h3>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://paypal.me/liujiacai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://paypal.me/liujiacai</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><figure><img src=\"https://liujiacai.net/images/weixinzhifu.jpg\" alt=\"微信支付\" width=\"200px\"><figcaption>\n\t\t\t<p>微信支付</p>\n\t\t</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<figure><img src=\"https://liujiacai.net/images/alipay.jpeg\" alt=\"支付宝\" width=\"200px\"><figcaption>\n\t\t\t<p>支付宝</p>\n\t\t</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
